# R122's line (Q1400): the Miner Llama v3 preset (release/flash-next-v3/settings.env) with R90's `gains` line on the
# v4 build, as every rig row of 2026-11-12 starts from it:
#   - R90's GAINS_ENV (docs/data/2026-11-11_r90_v4_vs_v3/run/r90.sh) without LLAMA_SAMPLING_TOP_K_ROWS=1 (FN84: it
#     changes the node count between micro-batches, so every request reallocates the prompt graph;
#     docs/data/2026-11-12_fn84_graph_realloc/);
#   - R90's GAINS_ARGS with --ubatch-taper short=600:64 in place of on (R60, docs/data/2026-11-12_r60_taper_v4/) and
#     --spec-draft-n-ubatch 512 in place of 128 (as R90's gains arm);
#   - plus C720's LLAMA_QSA_KPOOL_STAGE=1 (R80) and C719's LLAMA_QSA_POOL_MASK_DEV=1 (R78), both on top of C100's
#     LLAMA_QSA_KPOOL_DEV=1.
# The ladder's switches (run/r122_loads.sh) go on top of this, one rung at a time.
# Build: pascal-p106-v4 d097d6d88 (the kernel merge's rig tarball).
# Use: . preset.env && env $PRESET_ENV llama-server -m "$MODELS/$PRESET_MODEL" -md "$MODELS/$PRESET_DRAFT" $PRESET_ARGS --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8080
PRESET_MODEL=Swift-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-Q2_0-00001-of-00003.gguf
PRESET_DRAFT=mtp-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-draft.gguf
PRESET_ENV="GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_PASCAL_KCOL_SMEM=32768 GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_PASCAL_KCOL_TABLE=0 LLAMA_HOP_CAST=q8_0 GGML_CUDA_HOP_STAGED=1 LLAMA_DRAFT_SHORTLIST=32768,8192,2 GGML_CUDA_KEEPALIVE=decode GGML_CUDA_FATTN_SPARSE_PASCAL=1 GGML_CUDA_FATTN_SPARSE_PASCAL_MIN_RATIO=1.0 GGML_CUDA_FATTN_SPARSE_PASCAL_NSM=5 GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_PASCAL_DMT=1 GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_PASCAL_Q5K_MT=1 LLAMA_QSA_INDEXER_ROWS=1 LLAMA_QSA_KPOOL_DEV=1 LLAMA_QSA_KPOOL_STAGE=1 LLAMA_QSA_POOL_MASK_DEV=1"
PRESET_ARGS="-ngl 99 -fa on -c 65536 -np 1 -bs --ctx-checkpoints 4 --cache-ram 0 --jinja --reasoning-format deepseek --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --min-p 0 -b 2048 -ub 512 -ts 6,6,6,6,5,6,5,6,3 -fit off -lm dio --spec-type draft-mtp --spec-draft-n-max 3 -otd token_embd=CUDA4 --spec-draft-n-ubatch 512 --no-host --spec-draft-sampling probabilistic --spec-draft-p-min 0 --ctx-checkpoints-vram 4 --ctx-checkpoints-incall --ubatch-taper short=600:64"
